          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, enu mwashakama kuchi kumu chakaluŋalwiji, enu akwamuza wawaKereti! Eyi Kenani, ituŋa dawaFwilistinu, izu daYehova didi nanenu nandombu. Nakakukisaŋana chikupu, himwakashakama nawa muntuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchi kumu chakaluŋalwiji kwakekala kuwudiilu wawayimuna, kuwutuŋilu wamatala awatubiŋa nimayinda ayimuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchi kumu kwakekala kwambala kwawakwamutaŋa waYuda anashaluku; akadiishilaŋaku yimuna yawu. Hamelela akakambamaŋa mumatala amuAshekeloni; muloŋa Yehova Nzambi yawu wakayitalaŋa, wakayifuntishila cheŋi awu ayili muwukoli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami natiyi kusawula kwanayisa wuluwu kudi aMowabi, nimatuka anayitukoluwu kudi aAmoni, anasawuluwu nachu antu ami, chakudisambawu naŋinza yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yehova wamazaza, Nzambi yaIsarela, nindi, Chalala chinaha ndichi kwaamu, aMowabi akekala neyi Sodomi, anyana kaAmoni akekala neyi Gomora, kwakumenena tunyuŋi nimena amuŋwa, kumahembi ahaya nyaka. Antu ami anashaluku akayipupapupaŋa, antu akumuza wami anashaluku akayiheta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chumichi chakafuma hakudivwimba kwawu, nanochu chasawiluwu antu aYehova wamazaza nakudisamba nawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wakekala wakutiya woma kudi wena; wakakosesha akishi ahanu heseki, niantu akadifukulaŋa kudi yena, iwu nakufuma kwindi, iwu nakufuma kwindi, kafwampi yitutu yamunyuza yejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
